{{else}}
### `reset()`
{{/if}}

Restores every declared field of the game's state to its title-screen value: the
title screen with its first menu item highlighted, no board in play, `phase`
`idle` with `chainStep`, `swapTimer` and `stepTimer` at `0`, `score` at `0`,
`level` at `1`, `levelScore` at `0`, `lastCleared`, `lastPoints` and `lastWaves`
at `0`, `moveScore`, `bestMove` and `bestChain` at `0`, no selection, no offer,
no refusal and no armed target, no refill posed on any column, the pointer
reported as up and driven by `mouse`, and `simTime` at `0`.

`muted` is untouched; the runtime owns muting.

